      "input_default": {
        "model": "gpt-5.6-terra",
        "prompt": "You are a senior web designer. Create ONE complete self-contained HTML file (inline CSS and minimal inline JavaScript only, no external libraries, fonts or images, mobile first, responsive, dir=\"rtl\" and lang=\"ar\" if the language is Arabic) for a landing page in {{lang}}. Business: {{business}}. Goal: {{goal}}. Style: {{style}}. Contact: {{contact}}.\n\nStrict rules:\n1. Sections: sticky header with a working mobile hamburger menu (JS toggle), hero, benefits, how it works (3 steps), social proof, FAQ (details/summary), a booking/lead form (name, phone, message) with a clear submit button, and a footer.\n2. The form must work without a backend: if a WhatsApp number or email appears in the contact details, on submit build a wa.me link or mailto link with the form values and open it. Otherwise show a thank-you message.\n3. Never use external image URLs or placeholder services. Use CSS gradients, inline SVG icons and emoji for visuals.\n4. Never invent fake testimonials, fake customer names, fake statistics or fake prices. For social proof use a short trust section built only from facts in the business description, or neutral commitments (quality, response time) without numbers.\n5. Footer year must be dynamic: <span id=\"y\"></span> filled by JavaScript with new Date().getFullYear().\n6. Use the real contact details as clickable tel:, wa.me and mailto: links. Floating WhatsApp button if a number is given.\n7. Include meta viewport, a good title and meta description, sufficient contrast and large tap targets.\nReturn only the HTML in 'html' and a one-line page title in 'title'.",
        "expected_format": {
          "html": "Complete HTML document",
          "title": "Page title"
        }
      },
